# Renamed osynth Kconfig symbols. ESP-IDF applies these when it reads an
# sdkconfig written before the rename, so an existing build directory keeps
# its setting instead of silently falling back to the new choice's default.
#
# Format: OLD_NAME NEW_NAME (no CONFIG_ prefix).

# The loops-region size was named after ESP32-S3 module part numbers, which
# stopped making sense when the ESP32-P4 target arrived (its boards are N16R32
# — same 16 MB flash, different PSRAM). Renamed to the flash size alone.
OSYNTH_S3_FLASH_N8R8    OSYNTH_FLASH_8MB
OSYNTH_S3_FLASH_N16R8   OSYNTH_FLASH_16MB
